-  <h1>Enercon E82</h1>
-  <p class="kb-lead">82 metre rotor, gearless direct-drive. One of Enercon's most installed models, and it was built in several power ratings: the E82 E2 at 2.0 and 2.3 MW, the E82 E4 at 3.0 MW. Because the same rotor diameter was offered with different generator and control configurations, it pays to establish which variant you are standing under before saying &quot;E82&quot;.</p>
