-  <p class="kb-lead">Vestas designs are geared and use DFIG generators. The control system is mature and works well, but it needs tuning. The maintenance load concentrates in gearbox oil management and converter cooling.</p>
- <p>The most decisive difference across the series is the gearbox layout: V110 uses parallel-axis, V126 planetary, V136 a planetary–helical hybrid. That single choice changes weight, noise, oil volume and the character of the faults you will chase.</p>
