-  <p class="kb-kicker">Model guide</p>
-  <h1>Vestas V110/3.0M</h1>
-  <p class="kb-lead">3.0 MW rated power, 110 metre rotor. A workhorse of the mid-to-late 2000s and still running in numbers across Türkiye. The generation before the V126, and the last of the Vestas 3 MW machines built around a parallel-axis gearbox.</p>
-  <h2>Where it sits in the series</h2>
-  <div class="kb-table-scroll"><table>
-   <tr><th>Feature</th><th>V90</th><th>V110</th><th>V126</th></tr>
-   <tr><td>Rated power</td><td>2.0 MW</td><td><strong>3.0 MW</strong></td><td>3.3 MW</td></tr>
-   <tr><td>Rotor diameter</td><td>90 m</td><td><strong>110 m</strong></td><td>126 m</td></tr>
